OL,3,GNEWSAParent 'disgusted' by late sixth
OL,4,Aform change
OL,5,
OL,6,FA parent has said she is "disgusted" by
OL,7,Fa school's last-minute decision not to
OL,8,Ftake any Year 12 students this academic
OL,9,Fyear, despite sending offer letters and
OL,10,Fhosting an induction day for the pupils
OL,11,Fearlier this summer.
OL,13,FIn a letter sent to parents which has
OL,14,Fbeen seen by the BBC, Wellington
OL,15,FAcademy in Tidworth in Wiltshire, said
OL,16,Fthat it was "not viable" to enrol new
OL,17,Fstudents when the new academic year
OL,18,Fbegins on 4 September.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
