OL,3,GNEWSAParent 'disgusted' by late sixth
OL,4,Aform change
OL,5,
OL,6,FDebbie, mother of 17-year-old Chloe who
OL,7,Fhad accepted a place at the sixth form,
OL,8,Fsaid she was in a state of "absolute
OL,9,Fshock and a bit of panic" after the
OL,10,Fannouncement.
OL,12,FAscend Learning Trust, which runs the
OL,13,Fschool, has been approached for
OL,14,Fcomment.
